        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 368, Solid Brass Chic Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Solid Brass Chic Leverset from Omnia features a circular rose combined with a round lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting for a modern look. Easy to install, the Omnia 368 Chic Solid Brass Lever with Round Rose fits standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparations. It will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/chic-solid-brass-lever-with-square-rose-omnia-368s-00\"><b>Omnia 368S Chic Lever with Square Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Chic Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 368 Chic Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/locking-door-bars.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Chic Solid Brass Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "This Solid Brass Chic Leverset from Omnia features a circular rose combined with a round lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting for a modern look. Easy to install, the Omnia 368 Chic Solid Brass Lever with Round Rose fits standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparations. It will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-368/00, Omnia Modern Door lever, Modern door lever latchset, Omnia 368 door levers, modern circular rose levers, Omnia contemporary door levers, Modern Style Door Levers, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, ada compliant levers"
